"tr": {"text": "Şimdi gördün mü O yüz çevireni?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو کیا تم نے دیکھا جو پھر گیا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka apakah kamu melihat orang yang berpaling (dari Al-Quran)?", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "أَفَرَءَيْتَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَوَلَّىٰ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/32b5a6ded086a029e0a9.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it turned away", "bs": "okrenuo se"}}]}, {"ref": "37:90", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3878.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And they turned their backs and went away from him.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O zaman arkalarını dönerek başından kaçışıverdiler.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو وہ اس پر پیٹھ دے کر پھر گئے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Lalu mereka berpaling daripadanya dengan membelakang.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَتَوَلَّوْا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/681bc8b803176c50bc60.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pa su se okrenuli", "en": "so they turned away", "tr": "bunun üzerine yüz çevirdiler", "fr": "alors ils se détournèrent", "id": "lalu mereka berpaling", "ur": "پھر وہ پھر گئے", "bn": "তখন তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিল", "fa": "پس روی گرداندند"}}, {"text": "عَنْهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُدْبِرِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "7:196", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1150.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Lo! my Protecting Friend is Allah Who revealeth the Scripture. He befriendeth the righteous.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Zira benim velim, o kitabı indiren Allah'tır. Ve O, salih kullarına sahip çıkar.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "بیشک میرا والی اللہ ہے جس نے کتاب ا تاری اور وہ نیکوں کو دوست رکھتا ہے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Sesungguhnya pelindungku ialahlah Yang telah menurunkan Al Kitab (Al Quran) dan Dia melindungi orang-orang yang saleh.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلِۦِّىَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَزَّلَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْكِتَٰبَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَهُوَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَتَوَلَّى", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/8e59cabc834c96c6ef7d.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "brine se o", "en": "He takes care of", "tr": "üstlenir", "fr": "Il prend en charge", "id": "Dia mengurus", "ur": "وہ سرپرستی کرتا ہے", "bn": "তিনি দায়িত্ব নেন", "fa": "سرپرستی می‌کند"}}, {"text": "ٱلصَّٰلِحِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "8:20", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1180.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "O ye who believe! Obey Allah and His messenger, and turn not away from him when ye hear (him speak).", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ey iman edenler, Allah'a ve Resulü'ne itaat edin. İşitip durduğunuz halde onun emirlerinden yüz çevirmeyin!", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اے ایمان والو! اللہ اور اس کے رسول کا حکم مانو اور سن سنا کہ اسے نہ پھرو،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Hai orang-orang yang beriman, taatlah kepada Allah dan Rasul-Nya, dan janganlah kamu berpaling dari pada-Nya, sedang kamu mendengar (perintah-perintah-Nya),", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوٓا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَطِيعُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَرَسُولَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَوَلَّوْا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/24dfb3f43e27db42b77b.m4a", "gloss": null, "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "jussive"}]}, {"text": "عَنْهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَنتُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَسْمَعُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "47:22", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4567.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Would ye then, if ye were given the command, work corruption in the land and sever your ties of kinship?", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Demek siz iş başına gelecek olursanız yeryüzünde bozgunculuk çıkaracaksınız ve akrabalık bağlarınızı koparacaksınız öyle mi?", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو کیا تمہارے یہ لچھن نظر آتے ہیں کہ اگر تمہیں حکومت ملے تو زمین میں فساد پھیلاؤ اور اپنے رشتے کاٹ دو،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka apakah kira